  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Comparing differences with «als»",
     "texto": [
      "To compare two people, items of clothing or objects where one exceeds the other:",
      "1. **Adjective in the comparative (-er):**",
      "**schnell → schneller** (faster).",
      "**billig → billiger** (cheaper).",
      "**warm → wärmer** (warmer).",
      "**bequem → bequemer** (more comfortable).",
      "2. **Comparative conjunction «als»:**",
      "It works like «than» in English:",
      "**Das schwarze Handy ist schneller als das weiße Modell.** (The black phone is faster than the white model).",
      "**Dieses T-Shirt ist billiger als der Mantel.** (This T-shirt is cheaper than the coat).",
      "3. **Contrast with equality:**",
      "When two things are equal, **so ... wie** is used (as ... as):",
      "**Dieses Hemd ist so bequem wie mein Pullover.** (This shirt is as comfortable as my sweater).",
      "Don't mix them up: for differences you always use **als**; for equality you use **wie**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
